        <p>This guide is the on-ramp. The complete endpoint catalog — every filter, the note/link/attachment shapes, cursor pagination, graph queries, tag and config endpoints — lives in <a href="https://github.com/ParachuteComputer/parachute-vault/blob/main/docs/HTTP_API.md" target="_blank">the vault HTTP API reference</a>. The <a href="https://github.com/ParachuteComputer/parachute-vault/blob/main/docs/auth-model.md" target="_blank">auth model</a> covers the OAuth flow, token shapes, and scope semantics in depth.</p>

